      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100500302/1005003020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ということは、\r\nまだ余裕って感じだな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005003020020,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "さぁ、それはどうでしょー？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500302/1005003020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは\r\n……でもそうか、なら話しても大丈夫そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005003020030,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500302/1005003020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──摩美々に新しい仕事の話が来てる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ファッション誌のモデルのオファーだ\r\n摩美々が好きな、あの雑誌の──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005003020040,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……あぁ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500302/1005003020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "前回掲載された時の特集が\r\n大好評だったみたいでな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、今回はもっと大型の企画として\r\nカムバックをぜひ、ということだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005003020050,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そうなんですねー",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500302/1005003020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "先方からかなり熱い連絡をもらってさ、\r\nこんなものまで送ってくれたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
