    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──摩美々、嬉しそうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005003020080,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100500302/1005003020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005003020090,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "…………\r\n……嬉しい、とかじゃないですケド……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500302/1005003020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005003020100,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ただ、ファッションはずっと好きだから……\r\nそれだけなんで",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500302/1005003020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……でも、摩美々の『好き』、それだけの気持ちが\r\n誰かの心を動かしたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "誰かというか……\r\nこれだけの人たちのな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005003020110,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500302/1005003020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……さっきも伝えた通り、\r\n今回の記事は大型企画として扱われる予定だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005003020120,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……内容は決まってるんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500302/1005003020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、前回よりも摩美々自身の\r\nファッションセンスに焦点を当てたいらしく",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "摩美々が私服を持ち込み\r\n１週間コーディネートを組む、という内容だそうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005003020130,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ふーん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500302/1005003020130"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……摩美々\r\nレギュラーや既に決まっている仕事もある中",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『G.R.A.D.』の準備と\r\n時期も被ってて大変だとは思うけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──この仕事、受ける気はあるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
